                    "file": "configurations/meta/anacapa/anacapa_mb.json",
                    "line": 338,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "This board product name is unacceptable.  This product name is way too generic.  You have no way to differentiate this EEPROM value from a \"MB\" on some other random system.  We _must_ have a clear \"this is an Anacapa Board\" for each FRU in the system (unless it _is_ a generic FRU, like the BSM or a NIC).\n\nWe must have a manufacturer on all Probe statements."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/anacapa/anacapa_mb.json",
                    "line": 338,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "andychung113",
                        "username": "andychung113"
                    },
                    "message": "The board product name format is \"Anacapa <revision> <board>\", all Probe statements are modified and manufacturer is added."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/anacapa/anacapa_mb.json",
                    "line": 338,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "\u2764\ufe0f"
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/anacapa/anacapa_pdb_l.json",
                    "line": 259,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Unacceptable product name / probe statement."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/anacapa/anacapa_pdb_l.json",
